Manage metadata-only credential sources and per-tool bindings. Secret values stay in the backing provider and are delivered only to authorized server gateways.

Usage:
  mcp-runtime credential [command]

Available Commands:
  binding     Manage credential bindings
  configure   Configure the operator's verified HTTPS broker origin
  source      Manage credential sources

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for credential

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging

Use "mcp-runtime credential [command] --help" for more information about a command.
